  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObEl6L/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official | Momcozy S12 Pro Quick | S12 Momcozy Breast Pump | More Milk, Less Time | -292 mmHg Strong Suction | Wearable Hands-Free Pump | Shop the S12 Pro Quick | Best-Value Wearable Pump | S12 Pro Quick On Sale | Don't Miss This Week's Deal | Whisper-Quiet under 46dB | DoubleFit™ Hybrid Flange | Limited-Time Pump Deal | Order Online Now | Momcozy CA | Only 4 parts, 3-step setup. Pump easier, cleaner, faster every day. | 28% faster pumping at the best value. Limited deals on Canada's #1 reviewed wearable pump. | Same milk in 7 minutes that used to take 10 The wearable pump for moms who don't have time | Real reviews, real results. Try the upgraded pump moms keep coming back to.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObEl6L/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ 删除限时/最后机会等压力话术（真实活动以折扣规则表为准） ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObEl6L/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）；M03 未标注来源的效果数据声明；M04 制造焦虑的压力话术；M02 吸力夸大用语（建议改为客观档位描述）",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObEl6L/命中原因"
